  "chromePatterns": {
    "note": "Site furniture recorded as venue names. audit-corpus.mjs reports these and clean-corpus.mjs removes them. Every entry was paid for on a real topic - the comment names which. WORD BOUNDARIES MATTER: without the \\b, '^home' matched Homeslice and deleted a real pizzeria from three sources.",
